            "line_count": 2,
            "preview": "// QCodec defaults to UTF-8 charset and wraps output in RFC 1522 encoded-word format: =?UTF-8?Q?...?= final QCodec qcodec = new QCodec();"
          },
          {
            "start_line": 14,
            "end_line": 17,
            "line_count": 4,
            "preview": "// The '=' characters are unsafe in Q-encoding and must be hex-escaped as =3D. // '\\r' and '\\n' (CRLF) are control characters that must also be escaped as =0D and =0A. final String plainText = \"= Hello there =\\r\\n\";"
          },
          {
            "start_line": 19,
            "end_line": 20,
            "line_count": 2,
            "preview": "final String actualEncoded = qcodec.encode(plainText); assertEquals(expectedEncoded, actualEncoded, \"Basic Q encoding test\");"
